₹ 2.60 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  840 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.84 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1273 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.30 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nRustomjee Reserve's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Dahisar West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Rustomjee Reserve | Dahisar West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 31350 | 26850 |\n| Mar 2026 | 28850 | 24700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 24650 | 24250 |\n| Sep 2025 | 25900 | 24900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nRustomjee Reserve avg. price is ₹ 31.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Dahisar West at ₹ 26.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kolte Patil Evara](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-evara/113717/project \"Kolte Patil Evara\") | ₹ 36,800 |\n| [Rustomjee Summit](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-summit/3024/project \"Rustomjee Summit\") | ₹ 34,500 |\n| Current Project **Rustomjee Reserve** | ₹ 31,350 |\n| [Kolte Patil Vaayu](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kolte-patil-vaayu/105334/project \"Kolte Patil Vaayu\") | ₹ 30,700 |\n| Dahisar West | ₹ 26,850 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Dahisar West ranges from ₹ 30.6 K to ₹ 60.5 K with options available for 1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Rustomjee Reserve | In Dahisar West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 30.6 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 42.7 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 60.5 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Rustomjee Reserve.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 6 residential transactions has been registered so far for Rustomjee Reserve, amounting to ₹ 19 Cr till September 2026.\n\nRent in Rustomjee Reserve ranges from ₹ 45 K to ₹ 55 K with options available for 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Rustomjee Reserve moved from ₹ 28,850/sqft to ₹ 31,350/sqft, reflecting a 8.67% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Rustomjee Reserve moved from ₹ 24,650/sqft to ₹ 28,850/sqft, reflecting a 17.04% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 40% completion.\n\nRUSTOMJEE RESERVE, developed by PARTUM REALTORS PRIVATE LIMITED, officially launched on 19-Mar-2021 and expected to complete by 30-Dec-2025. Registered under RERA No. P51800028564. The project comprises 1 towers and offers 197 residential units, including SHOP, 2 BHK, 3 BHK, with unit sizes ranging from 409 to 1173 Square feet across a total area of 0.19 Acre.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n6 Sales Transactions Registered in Rustomjee Reserve From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 26.4 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 6 | ₹ 19 Cr | ₹ 26,400 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Rustomjee Reserve Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 769 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rustomjee Reserve, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/rustomjee-reserve-apartment-2-bhk-769sqft-20233606173615.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.60 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 840 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rustomjee Reserve, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/rustomjee-reserve-apartment-2-bhk-840sqft-20233606173649.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.84 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1273 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Rustomjee Reserve, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/rustomjee-reserve-apartment-3-bhk-1273sqft-20233706173707.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.30 Cr\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in Rustomjee Reserve\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in Rustomjee Reserve, Mumbai.\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Rustomjee Reserve in Dahisar West, Mumbai]()\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Rustomjee Reserve in Dahisar West, Mumbai]()\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Rustomjee Reserve in Dahisar West, Mumbai]()\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![Sunil Ransure]()\n\nClassic Property\n\nOur Home\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Rustomjee Reserve\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Rustomjee Reserve to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making yo