mbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-summit-flagshipimg1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Rustomjee Summit](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rustomjee-summit/3024/project \"Rustomjee Summit\")\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Ajmera Manor project in Borivali West, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-ajmera-manor-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Ajmera Manor](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ajmera-manor/25755/project \"Ajmera Manor\")\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Rustomjee Track Record\n\n![Rustomjee logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rustomjee-599.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMumbai’s renowned developers, Rustomjee Company, is a brand that has ruled the city with exquisite architectural designs. It has delivered approximately every construction style, including housing services, retail outlets, corporate spaces and even independent houses. Found in 1996, Rustomjee builder has covered almost 30 million square feet of land in the city of dreams. \nThe developers have maintained an identity in niche infrastructure in their portfolio that counts 12 million square feet of land with completed projects and 15 million square feet of land with under-construction projects. Besides this, the other 30 million square feet is the projects which are yet in the pipeline. \nCurrently, this giant developer only owns the biggest township in Mumbai. Apart from this, there are localities where they build hospitals and educational institutes in the most potential localities in the town. Namely, Rustomjee Developers have a good command of projects in Upper Juhu, BKC Annex,  Kandivali, Khar, Borivali, Virar and Thane. \nBesides this, Rustomjee real estate has a notion of bringing a child-friendly environment to the buyers with the perfect blend of peace, style and comfort. All their projects grant personalised living experiences with effective spacing. Moreover, they also ensure quality construction qualities with family-welcoming zones.\n\n![Rustomjee Ozone Skye residential project in Goregaon West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-ozone-skye-project-flagship-opt-86d0b5d1-ea30-48ec-8de6-681535ff0790.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.63 Cr to 3.81 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Vista Bay residential project in Parel](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-vista-bay-project-flagship-opt-1e010c55-e7ea-45cd-9402-84d25d8255ea.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nParel, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.75 Cr to 6.49 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Thirty3.15 residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-thirty3.15-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\n₹ 4.56 Cr to 11.81 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Bandstand Cama residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-bandstand-cama-project-flagship-opt-aa1f8b5f-e119-4e80-9fe3-8198eb1a1ee4.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\n5 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rustomjee Crescent residential project in Pali Hill](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-crescent-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nPali Hill, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 12.40 Cr to 17.81 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Cliff Tower residential project in Bandra West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-cliff-tower-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra West, Mumbai\n\n4, 5 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 38.12 Cr to 62.31 Cr\n\n![Rustomje