policy)\n* [Terms & Condition](/site/terms-conditions)\n\n##### Our Brands\n\n* [CRE Matrix](https://www.crematrix.com)\n* [CRE Lease Matrix](https://www.creleasematrix.com)\n* [Floortap](https://www.floortap.com/)\n\n##### Contact Us\n\n[+91 7736973697](tel:917736973697)\n\nRERA Code - A51900036747\n\n##### Available on\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://blox.xyz/projects/rustomjee-reserve","title":"Rustomjee Reserve In Dahisar West | Buy 2 & 3 BHK in Mumbai","raw_content":"![Blox Logo](/assets/images/blox-logo-white.svg)\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nDiscover. Experience. Buy.\n\nGet Personalized experience\n\nby logging in\n\nLogin / Register\n\n[Properties in Mumbai](/buy/mumbai/1a256)\n\n>\n\n[Properties in Dahisar West](/buy/mumbai/dahisar-west-1a256b7a43)\n\n>\n\nRustomjee Builders\n\n>\n\n![share-primary](/assets/icons/share-primary.svg)\n\n![compare-inactive-secondary](/assets/icons/compare-inactive-secondary.svg)\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rustomjee-builders-rustomjee-reserve-bedroom-1666244442.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rustomjee-builders-rustomjee-reserve-bedroom-1666244421.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rustomjee-builders-rustomjee-reserve-bedroom-1666006687.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rustomjee-builders-rustomjee-reserve-1666244347.webp)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/rustomjee-builders-rustomjee-reserve-bedroom-1671781084.webp)VIEW ALL\n\n![Propert-Icon](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031121044517-download.jpeg)\n\n# Rustomjee Reserve\n\nRustomjee Reserve, Rangnath Keskar Marg, Jaywant Sawant Marg, next to BMC Building, Dahisar West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400068\n\nDahisar West\n\n₹2.67 Cr - 4.42 Cr\n\n₹2.67 Cr - 4.42 Cr\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n[Price & Floor Plan](#Price & Floor Plan)\n\n![video-primary](/assets/icons/video-primary.svg)\n\n![call-rm](/assets/icons/call-rm.svg)\n\n![calendar-primary](/assets/icons/calendar-primary.svg)\n\nBOOK PROPERTY\n\n## Overview\n\nRustomjee Reserve is a premium residential project in Dahisar, Mumbai, situated within the well-established Rustomjee Acres township. This elegant multi-storeyed tower offers beautifully designed 2 & 3 BHK homes in Mumbai, surrounded by 50,000 sq. ft. of open green spaces & children’s play areas. Thoughtfully planned to provide serene views, refreshing westerly breezes & tranquil sunsets, Rustomjee Reserve Dahisar blends modern living with the charm of nature. With sophisticated design, contemporary amenities & a prime location, it is an ideal choice for families and investors seeking luxury homes in Dahisar & promising real estate opportunities in Mumbai.\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2025\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹34,720/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n769 - 1273 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Experience the tranquility of Dahisar, a peaceful and scenic locale.\n* Join a well-established residential neighborhood that fosters community and connection.\n* Enjoy breathtaking views of 50,000 sq. ft. of beautifully landscaped green open spaces.\n* Reside in a premium standalone multi-storey tower within the esteemed Rustomjee Acres community.\n\n* Discover elegantly designed 2 and 3 BHK homes that redefine modern living.\n* Indulge in luxury lifestyle amenities complemented by spacious layouts for ultimate comfort.\n* Benefit from natural ventilation in your home, along with stunning sunset views and a gentle westerly breeze.\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\n![up-thumb](/assets/icons/up-thumb.svg)\n\n### The good things\n\nConnectivity\n\nThe project is located within 2 kilometers of both Dahisar and Borivali railway stations and is close to the upcoming metro lines.\n\nEstablished Neighborhood\n\nBeing part of Rustomjee Acres ensures a well-maintained environment with existing infrastructure like Rustomjee International School nearby.\n\nLuxury Amenities\n\nFeatures such as the rooftop cabana, open-sky gymnasium, and co-working spaces are highly rated for modern urban living.\n\nDesign and Layout\n\nThe apartments are noted for being spacious with large windows that provide ample natural light and cross-ventilation.\n\nReputed Developer\n\nReviewers express high trust in the Rustomjee brand for its track record of delivery and construction standards.\n\n![down-thumb](/assets/icons/down-thumb.svg)\n\n### Needs improvement\n\nLocal Traffic\n\nThe Rustom Irani Marg and nearby access roads often face heavy congestion during peak office hours.\n\nWaterlogging Issues\n\nSome residents have mentioned that low-lying areas in Dahisar West are prone to minor waterlogging during heavy monsoons.\n\nParking Space\n\nVisitor parking is limited, which can be a challenge for residents hosting guests.\n\nPremium Pricing\n\nThe project carries a significant price premium compared to other standalone buildings in the Dahisar West locality.\n\n---\n\nThe Verdict\n\nGreat for families\n\nExcellent for remote workers\n\nHigh investment potential\n\nIdeal for station commuters\n\nPremium lifestyle choice\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/indoor-games-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/indoor-games-secondary.svg)\n\nIndoor Games\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Multi-purpose-court-secondary](/asset