ssets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nAum Superspeciality Hospital - Best Cashless & Emergency Hospital In Borivali West L Orthopaedic & Gynaecologist In Dahisar\n\n0.2 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nShri Harilal Bhagwati Municipal Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nKaruna Hospital\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nNamita Hospital\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nNavneet Hitech Hospital\n\n0.6 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nNavneet Hospital Manav Kalyan Hospital\n\n0.6 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹2,79,009per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹3,34,81,041\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nRustomjee Reserveis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800028564](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800028564)\n\nReserve\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Rustomjee Reserve is 30 Jun 2025\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Rustomjee Reserve is 769 - 1273 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Rustomjee Reserve is ₹2.67 Cr - 4.42 Cr\n\n### Where is Rustomjee Reserve located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRustomjee Reserve is located at Rustomjee Reserve, Rangnath Keskar Marg, Jaywant Sawant Marg, next to BMC Building, Dahisar West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400068.\n\n### What configurations are available in Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nRustomjee Reserve has 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Rustomjee Reserve is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Intercom Facility, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Senior citizen Area, Swimming Pool, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Rustomjee Reserve?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Rustomjee Reserve is Rustomjee Builders.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Rustomjee Reserve:Rustomjee Builders](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031121044517-download.jpeg)\n\n## Rustomjee Builders\n\nRustomjee Developers and Builders Mumbai is a leading real estate developer delivering world-class projects in Mumbai for over two decades. The company has established a strong reputation for delivering quality homes catering to its customer's diverse needs. The company's projects are known for their modern architecture, luxurious amenities, and attention to detail. Rustomjee Developers has also won several prestigious awards for its projects, including the 'Best Residential High-Rise Development and Best Design and Architecture awards. The company's commitment to excellence, integrity, and transparency has made it a trusted name among homebuyers in Mumbai.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/blue-ocean-realty-ozone-residency-1748238601.jpg)\n\n![Ozone Residency](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/220125114617-newproject-33.webp)\n\nOzone Residency\n\nDahisar West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹95 L - 1.5 Cr\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/m-k-realtors-mk-aavaas-classic-elevation-1691567427.webp)\n\n![MK Aavaas Classic](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/030323124315-download.webp)\n\nMK Aavaas Classic\n\nDahisar West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹45.9 L - 78.2 L\n\n1, 2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/gagangiri-development-gagangiri-complex-elevation-1691219730.webp)\n\n![Gagangiri Complex](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/050823122344-newproject-2023-08-05t122235617.webp)\n\nGagangiri Complex\n\nDahisar West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.64 Cr - 2.66 Cr\n\n1, 2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/swarupa-construction-swarupa-datta-leela-residency-elevation-1686547658.webp)\n\n![Swarupa Datta Leela Residency](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/120623104210-newproject-2023-06-12t104150446.webp)\n\nSwarupa Datta Leela Residency\n\nDahisar West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![ph